{"version":"3.30.0","league":"Covens of Umbra","engineTree":"3.30","topics":[{"id":"fates","name":"Fates and Grim Fates","text":"Coven encounters offer Fates that empower the area boss and add rewards. Pick a Fate to see the next set of choices. Stacking Fates makes regular boss Viscera more likely. Grim Fate Pinnacle bosses guarantee their Viscera.","source":"https://www.pathofexile.com/forum/view-thread/4013527","tags":["fate","bossing"]},{"id":"wickerman","name":"Wickerman and Viscera","text":"Equip boss Viscera at the Wickerman for character-specific effects. Inspect the slot, exact tier and conditions before planning a combination. Compare each effect with the skill that actually deals damage in your build.","source":"https://www.pathofexile.com/forum/view-thread/4013858","tags":["viscera"]},{"id":"threads","name":"Threads and Shaped Regions","text":"Threads replace Scarabs. You can spend up to eight to add encounters and improve the chance of transformative effects. Atlas regions provide free Threads and Astrolabes can move a region.","source":"https://www.pathofexile.com/forum/view-thread/4013680","tags":["atlas","mapping"]},{"id":"item-tier","name":"Tiered item drops","text":"Dropped equipment can have an item tier that improves its odds of better affixes and other properties. Monster and map rarity can affect currency outcomes. Rarity from player gear does not improve currency drops through this rule.","source":"https://www.pathofexile.com/forum/view-thread/4013527","tags":["gear","mapping"]},{"id":"mirage","name":"Mirage goes core","text":"Mirage returns as core endgame content. Recheck reward sources and Atlas passives when a build depends on loot from the old league.","source":"https://www.pathofexile.com/forum/view-thread/4013680","tags":["atlas"]},{"id":"crafting","name":"Crafting and vendor changes","text":"The attack and caster metamods no longer protect those modifiers from some removals such as Orb of Annulment. Vendors no longer sell Orbs of Chance, and Orbs of Binding no longer drop.","source":"https://www.pathofexile.com/forum/view-thread/4013680","tags":["gear"]},{"id":"vendigo","name":"Hide of the Vendigo","text":"Grants added cold damage to unarmed attacks and lets an empty main hand use claw attacks. For Flicker, test single-target Frenzy sustain and compare against an independently working sword or claw setup.","source":"https://poedb.tw/us/Hide_of_the_Vendigo","tags":["unique","melee","flicker"]},{"id":"covetous","name":"The Covetous Dark","text":"Physical claw with permanent Blind. It can acquire two modifiers by blinding previously unblinded eligible Pinnacle bosses. Check the actual rolled modifiers before evaluating the weapon.","source":"https://poedb.tw/us/The_Covetous_Dark","tags":["unique","melee"]},{"id":"sword","name":"The Sword of Ages","text":"Two-handed sword that triggers Temporal Mirage on movement attacks. Its mirage casts eligible spells socketed in the weapon. Measure the attack and spell components independently when planning a hybrid build.","source":"https://poedb.tw/us/The_Sword_of_Ages","tags":["unique","melee","flicker","spell"]},{"id":"seed","name":"Putrid Seed","text":"A Blight jewel for a large jewel socket. Its anointment grows four random notables from candidates influenced by the oils. Treat the rolled nodes as an upgrade after checking their passive-point cost.","source":"https://www.pathofexile.com/forum/view-thread/4014080","tags":["unique","gear","atlas"]},{"id":"new-gems","name":"Arcane Link and Fireball of Radiation","text":"Arcane Link gives a linked ally added lightning damage based on your mana. Fireball of Radiation applies a fire damage-over-time debuff. Check their client records and whether your PoB version can simulate them.","source":"https://www.pathofexile.com/forum/view-thread/4013680","tags":["gem","spell"]}],"threads":["Abyss Thread","Breach Thread","Blight Thread","Legion Thread","Expedition Thread","Ultimatum Thread","Ritual Thread","Bestiary Thread